WHY A NEW SHAPE (AC-PPR13)
The producer seeds a throwaway demo ledger through the shipped Ledger API.
Every tx id is compute_tx_id(ts_utc, ...) and _write_tx takes the wall clock,
so a later run cannot reproduce the three ids unless the clock is pinned to the
second the landed report stamped. The replay pins ledger.now_utc to that second,
re-seeds through the producer's own seed_demo, runs the shipped reconcile IN
PROCESS (stdout captured; no child process) and renders with build_html.

